title: "MFF Timing Inspector"
abstract: "A native macOS app for checking EGI/Philips Neuroscience MFF recording timing against the diagnostics egi-pynetstation writes while sending ECI events: event-vs-DIN offset analysis, NTP/drift-model stability, and dropped-display-frame correlation."
